# --- Files the notebooks generate when students run them ----------------------
# These are outputs, not inputs: every one is written by an earlier cell of the
# same notebook before it is read again. Keeping them out of the repository
# stops student runs from showing up as local modifications.
Day4/germany_party_account*.txt
Day4/germany_party_account*.csv
Day4/tweet_example.json
Day4/tweet_example.pickle
Day4/tweets_example.json
Day4/test.csv
Day4/fibo.py
Day5/myfig.jpg
Day5/word_count.py
Day5/greet.py

